      "start": 10059,
      "quote": "It has been 250 years \nsince we declared independence. As we celebrate this milestone, I think \nit is all the more worthy that we pass this bill and begin construction \nof the museum dedicated to the history of American women.\n  Throughout our history, women have played a pivotal role in so many \nof our Nation's most celebrated achievements and innovations.",
