      "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CREC-2026-05-21/html/CREC-2026-05-21-pt1-PgH3692.htm",
      "start": 24258,
      "quote": "Mr. Speaker, I rise in opposition to this amended bill. I \nwas a proud cosponsor of the bill, as introduced. Yet, instead of \nmoving the bipartisan text, Republicans have hijacked this bill to give \nPresident Trump complete and total authority over the Smithsonian \nAmerican Women's History Museum's location.",
